{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux经异常PAM授权方认证。对应需求：持久化。官方：Authentication via Unusual PAM Grantor。","from":"now-9m","index":["auditbeat-*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux经异常PAM授权方认证","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux经异常PAM授权方认证\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","risk_score":47,"rule_id":"a8aaa49d-9834-462d-bf8f-b1255cebc004","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"event.category:authentication and host.os.type:linux and event.action:authenticated and event.outcome:success and\nauditd.data.grantors:(* and not (pam_rootok or *pam_cap* or *pam_permit*))\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1543","name":"Create or Modify System Process","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1543/"},{"id":"T1556","name":"Modify Authentication Process","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1556/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1556.003","name":"Pluggable Authentication Modules","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1556/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1556","name":"Modify Authentication Process","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1556/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1556.003","name":"Pluggable Authentication Modules","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1556/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["auditd.data.grantors"],"history_window_start":"now-5d","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":7,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
